class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AssociatedNonnegativeFormOperator}_S(L,q,H)\">\\(\\mathrm{AssociatedNonnegativeFormOperator}_S(L,q,H)\\)</span> (form-representation predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SelfAdjoint}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SelfAdjoint}_S\\)</span> (self-adjoint-operator predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> (measurable-map predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchrodingerFormOperator}_S(L,q,V,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{SchrodingerFormOperator}_S(L,q,V,d)\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}associated\\text{-}nonnegative\\text{-}form\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\\mathrm{AssociatedNonnegativeFormOperator}_S(L,q,H)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SelfAdjoint}_S(L,H)\\land\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{dom}(L)\\;(\\langle L(u),u\\rangle_H\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\\operatorname{dom}(q)=\\operatorname{dom}(L^{1/2})\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(q)\\;(q(u,v)=\\langle L^{1/2}(u),L^{1/2}(v)\\rangle_H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}associated\\text{-}nonnegative\\text{-}form\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\\mathrm{AssociatedNonnegativeFormOperator}_S(L,q,H)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SelfAdjoint}_S(L,H)\\land\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{dom}(L)\\;(\\langle L(u),u\\rangle_H\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\\operatorname{dom}(q)=\\operatorname{dom}(L^{1/2})\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(q)\\;(q(u,v)=\\langle L^{1/2}(u),L^{1/2}(v)\\rangle_H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}schrodinger\\text{-}form\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\\mathrm{SchrodingerFormOperator}_S(L,q,V,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\bigl(V;(\\mathbb R^d,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B([0,\\infty]))\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(q)=H^1(\\mathbb R^d)\\cap L^2(V\\,dx)\\land\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{dom}(q)\\;\\bigl(q(u,u)=\\|\\nabla u\\|_2^2+\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}V|u|^2\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{AssociatedNonnegativeFormOperator}_S(L,q,L^2(\\mathbb R^d))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}schrodinger\\text{-}form\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\\mathrm{SchrodingerFormOperator}_S(L,q,V,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\bigl(V;(\\mathbb R^d,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B([0,\\infty]))\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(q)=H^1(\\mathbb R^d)\\cap L^2(V\\,dx)\\land\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{dom}(q)\\;\\bigl(q(u,u)=\\|\\nabla u\\|_2^2+\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}V|u|^2\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{AssociatedNonnegativeFormOperator}_S(L,q,L^2(\\mathbb R^d))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fabes\\text{-}straube}\\vdash \\mathrm{SchrodingerFormOperator}_S(L,q,V,d)\\to\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\left\\|\\nabla e^{-tL}\\right\\|_{L^2\\to L^2}\\leq\\left\\|L^{1/2}e^{-tL}\\right\\|_{L^2\\to L^2}\\leq(2et)^{-1/2}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fabes\\text{-}straube}\\vdash \\mathrm{SchrodingerFormOperator}_S(L,q,V,d)\\to\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\left\\|\\nabla e^{-tL}\\right\\|_{L^2\\to L^2}\\leq\\left\\|L^{1/2}e^{-tL}\\right\\|_{L^2\\to L^2}\\leq(2et)^{-1/2}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The closed form <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> is now an explicit argument of the typing predicate; the assertion no longer depends on a free prose-only symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_V\">\\(q_V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The legacy filename is retained for link stability. No unverified “Fabes–Straube” attribution, Navier–Stokes consequence, ultracontractivity, or ground-state weight is asserted.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-operator","status":"resolved","id":"5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-self-adjoint-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"6da70a87682c611a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-self-adjoint-operator.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d,V,L,q,u,v,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AssociatedNonnegativeFormOperator}_S(L,q,H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SelfAdjoint}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchrodingerFormOperator}_S(L,q,V,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}associated\\text{-}nonnegative\\text{-}form\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\\mathrm{AssociatedNonnegativeFormOperator}_S(L,q,H)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SelfAdjoint}_S(L,H)\\land\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{dom}(L)\\;(\\langle L(u),u\\ra